OL,3,GNEWSAMen held in major incident near
OL,4,ARAF base as homes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Whelford, near RAF
OL,7,FFairford, have been taken to a leisure
OL,8,Fcentre while investigations continue,
OL,9,Fpolice said. A cordon is currently in
OL,10,Fplace in the area and officers say they
OL,11,Fbelieve the incident is contained.
OL,13,FThe base has been recently used to
OL,14,Fdeploy American bombers since the
OL,15,Fcountry's conflict in Iran began on 28
OL,16,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
